GMS compatibility source patches for crDroid 17.0 (Android 17)
Public edition prepared 2026-10-01.
crDroid 17.0 edition, 2026-10-20: strict apply and reverse at the reference commits in this
NOTICE. Device-verified on a OnePlus 13 on 2026-10-27 (crDroid 17.0 build of 2026-10-25,
repository commit 4bdecab): Play services force-queryable, Clock alarm works, no removed
Pixel package in the system image, no uses-library errors in the log. The current Play Store
version of Google Clock no longer requests SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM. The crDroid 16.0 edition is
kept on branch 16.0 of this repository.

Reference repositories, commits and public sources:
  frameworks/base c2382c14b024f5701071d31d9cc8fe1401dc9a88 https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android_frameworks_base
  vendor/gms d5490a1323f348fff1cc35f091b29ba583c67a84 https://github.com/Evolution-X/vendor_gms branch=cnb

The optional fourth field branch=cnb selects the vendor's Android 17 branch
when check-reference.sh is run with --branch. Pinned checks always use the SHA.

Changes are limited to source/build-configuration diffs. No APKs, libraries,
firmware or vendor binary payloads are included. The vendor sources being
patched include Apache 2.0 notices from Evolution X and The Android Open
Source Project; retain those per-file notices. This module's changes and
