Reference setup of the 16.0 edition: OnePlus 13, crDroid 16.0 with vendor/gms
branch bka (89c3940a77298c204c55a21efded92ddafb59fe9).
The GMS visibility change follows a locally used fix. The public edition as a
whole has source apply/reverse checks only; no new ROM build or device test.
Other vendors, vendor revisions and devices require their own validation.

